PERSONAL PROJECT NOTICE:

This is a personal pet project created in 2024 for the following purposes:
1. To simplify workflow processes within my company
2. To demonstrate technical skills

The project serves as a practical example of:
- Multi-language Telegram bot development
- Clean code architecture with decorators and separation of concerns
- Comprehensive testing and CI/CD implementation
- Production-ready deployment practices
- Internationalization and user experience design

This software is actively used in a production environment and maintained
as part of a professional portfolio.
